STARTFONT 2.1
COMMENT Glinda 12: the Room Editor's help text.
COMMENT The glyphs of the Geneva 12 bitmap font, from the System file of Executor
COMMENT (https://github.com/autc04/executor, MIT license), re-encoded.
COMMENT The MAC_ properties keep QuickDraw font metrics; the missing-character glyph is ENCODING -1.
FONT Glinda-12
SIZE 12 72 72
FONTBOUNDINGBOX 14 15 0 -3
STARTPROPERTIES 11
FAMILY_NAME "Glinda"
PIXEL_SIZE 12
POINT_SIZE 120
FONT_ASCENT 12
FONT_DESCENT 3
DEFAULT_CHAR -1
MAC_LEADING 1
MAC_WIDMAX 15
MAC_KERNMAX 0
MAC_NDESCENT -12
MAC_FRECTWIDTH 15
ENDPROPERTIES
